   "text": "The AI forgets EVERYTHING when a chat ends. These files are its memory: it reads them before touching any code. What's written there is what the AI 'knows'.",
   "originalText": "The AI forgets EVERYTHING when a chat ends. These files are its memory: it reads them before touching any code. What's written there is what the AI 'knows'.",
