   "text": "🚪 CLAUDE.md\n= the rules sign at the door\n\nINSIDE: project name, commands (npm run dev /\nbuild / lint), the Next.js 16 warning,\narchitecture notes and @links to the 4 Context\nfiles.\nWHEN: loaded automatically at the start of\nEVERY chat.\nREAL LINE: \"@Context/current-feature.md\" →\nthis makes the AI also open that file.",
   "originalText": "🚪 CLAUDE.md\n= the rules sign at the door\n\nINSIDE: project name, commands (npm run dev /\nbuild / lint), the Next.js 16 warning,\narchitecture notes and @links to the 4 Context\nfiles.\nWHEN: loaded automatically at the start of\nEVERY chat.\nREAL LINE: \"@Context/current-feature.md\" →\nthis makes the AI also open that file.",
