   "text": "🗺️ project-overview.md\n= the picture on the LEGO box\n\nINSIDE: the problem, the users, all features,\nthe 7 item types with colors, the database\nschema, tech stack, prices, UI layout.\nWHEN: every chat (CLAUDE.md links it).\nREAL LINE: \"Snippet | Code | #3b82f6 (blue)\".\nNOTE: 760 lines = expensive to read every\ntime.",
