   "text": "📏 coding-standards.md\n= the house rules\n\nINSIDE: TypeScript strict (no 'any'), server\ncomponents by default, Tailwind v4, Zod for\nvalidation, file naming rules.\nWHEN: every chat.\nREAL LINE: \"DO NOT create tailwind.config.ts\"\n→ this stopped the AI from making a v3\nmistake.",
   "originalText": "📏 coding-standards.md\n= the house rules\n\nINSIDE: TypeScript strict (no 'any'), server\ncomponents by default, Tailwind v4, Zod for\nvalidation, file naming rules.\nWHEN: every chat.\nREAL LINE: \"DO NOT create tailwind.config.ts\"\n→ this stopped the AI from making a v3\nmistake.",
