   "text": "📌 current-feature.md\n= today's to-do sticky note\n\nINSIDE: Current Feature, Status, Goals, Notes,\nHistory.\nWHEN: every chat, so a NEW chat instantly\nknows what is in progress.\nREAL LINE: \"Status: In Progress\" → later\n\"Completed\" + a line in History.",
