   "text": "🎨 src/lib/constants/item-types.ts\n= the color dictionary\n\nINSIDE: ITEM_TYPE_ICONS (which icon per type)\nand ITEM_TYPE_STYLES (which Tailwind color\nclasses per type).\nWHY: ONE place to change a color, instead of\n20 files.\nREAL: snippet → Code icon + text-snippet\n(blue).",
