   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "You write a small file in Context/Features/, for example dashboard-phase-1-spec.md. It\nalways has 3 parts:\n1. OVERVIEW: which piece this is (\"phase 1 of 3 for the dashboard\").\n2. REQUIREMENTS: a short bullet list of what must exist when it's done.\n3. REFERENCES: @links to the files the AI must open (screenshot, overview, mock data).\nThe @link is like saying \"also read this page\". If the path is wrong, the AI can't open\nit and has to GUESS.\nYou also decide what is NOT in this phase. That keeps every step small and easy to\ncheck.",
   "originalText": "You write a small file in Context/Features/, for example dashboard-phase-1-spec.md. It\nalways has 3 parts:\n1. OVERVIEW: which piece this is (\"phase 1 of 3 for the dashboard\").\n2. REQUIREMENTS: a short bullet list of what must exist when it's done.\n3. REFERENCES: @links to the files the AI must open (screenshot, overview, mock data).\nThe @link is like saying \"also read this page\". If the path is wrong, the AI can't open\nit and has to GUESS.\nYou also decide what is NOT in this phase. That keeps every step small and easy to\ncheck.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "plan_w",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
