   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Requirements of phase 1:\n• Set up ShadCN UI (a box of ready-made buttons, inputs...)\n• A /dashboard page\n• Dark mode by default\n• Top bar with search + \"New Item\" button (only visual)\n• \"Sidebar\" and \"Main\" placeholders\nLater you added: \"use the EXACT colors of the screenshot\" and\n\"show a couple of example cards\". We wrote that INTO the spec so\nthe spec stays the truth.",
   "originalText": "Requirements of phase 1:\n• Set up ShadCN UI (a box of ready-made buttons, inputs...)\n• A /dashboard page\n• Dark mode by default\n• Top bar with search + \"New Item\" button (only visual)\n• \"Sidebar\" and \"Main\" placeholders\nLater you added: \"use the EXACT colors of the screenshot\" and\n\"show a couple of example cards\". We wrote that INTO the spec so\nthe spec stays the truth.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "plan_r",
