   "text": "The references said @context/screenshots/dashboard-ui-main.png,\nbut:\n• the real folder is Context/Screenshots/ (capital letters)\n• that image didn't even exist\nWe fixed it to Devdash-dark.png.\nPhases 2 and 3 still have the same broken links, so fix them\nbefore starting those phases.",
