   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "You ask the AI to copy the feature into current-feature.md.\nThe AI reads the spec and fills in: Current Feature (name), Status (In Progress), Goals\n(short list), Notes (link to the spec).\nWhy it matters: CLAUDE.md loads this file in EVERY chat. If you close the chat and open\na new one tomorrow, the AI reads it and knows exactly what's in progress. It's the save\ngame of your work.",
   "originalText": "You ask the AI to copy the feature into current-feature.md.\nThe AI reads the spec and fills in: Current Feature (name), Status (In Progress), Goals\n(short list), Notes (link to the spec).\nWhy it matters: CLAUDE.md loads this file in EVERY chat. If you close the chat and open\na new one tomorrow, the AI reads it and knows exactly what's in progress. It's the save\ngame of your work.",
