   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The AI runs: git checkout -b feature/dashboard-phase-1\nA branch is a parallel timeline. It starts as an exact copy of main, but new save points\n(commits) only go to the branch.\nmain keeps working. If the experiment goes badly, you throw the branch away and nothing\nis broken.\nNaming rule (from ai-interaction.md): feature/[name] for new things, fix/[name] for\nbugs.",
   "originalText": "The AI runs: git checkout -b feature/dashboard-phase-1\nA branch is a parallel timeline. It starts as an exact copy of main, but new save points\n(commits) only go to the branch.\nmain keeps working. If the experiment goes badly, you throw the branch away and nothing\nis broken.\nNaming rule (from ai-interaction.md): feature/[name] for new things, fix/[name] for\nbugs.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "branch_w",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
