   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "You asked: \"but are we on main?\" Changes that are NOT committed\ndon't belong to any branch: they follow you if you switch.\nCheck with: git branch --show-current\nOn GitHub, the Features/ folder \"was missing\": it was on the\nbranch, and GitHub shows main by default. Change the branch\ndropdown to see it.",
   "originalText": "You asked: \"but are we on main?\" Changes that are NOT committed\ndon't belong to any branch: they follow you if you switch.\nCheck with: git branch --show-current\nOn GitHub, the Features/ folder \"was missing\": it was on the\nbranch, and GitHub shows main by default. Change the branch\ndropdown to see it.",
