   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. The AI READS: CLAUDE.md → the Context files → current-feature.md → the spec → its\n   references.\n2. It reads the Next.js 16 docs inside node_modules (this version changed a lot, so it\n   doesn't trust old memory).\n3. It runs tools: npx shadcn init (creates components.json, utils.ts, button.tsx and\n   theme colors in globals.css), then npx shadcn add input kbd.\n4. It writes the code: src/app/dashboard/layout.tsx (sidebar + main), page.tsx,\n   components/layout/TopBar.tsx, and the class \"dark\" on <html>.\n5. It follows the house rules: server components, Tailwind only, no inline styles,\n   TypeScript interfaces for props.\n6. You watch every change in VS Code: GREEN lines = added, RED lines = removed.",
   "originalText": "1. The AI READS: CLAUDE.md → the Context files → current-feature.md → the spec → its\n   references.\n2. It reads the Next.js 16 docs inside node_modules (this version changed a lot, so it\n   doesn't trust old memory).\n3. It runs tools: npx shadcn init (creates components.json, utils.ts, button.tsx and\n   theme colors in globals.css), then npx shadcn add input kbd.\n4. It writes the code: src/app/dashboard/layout.tsx (sidebar + main), page.tsx,\n   components/layout/TopBar.tsx, and the class \"dark\" on <html>.\n5. It follows the house rules: server components, Tailwind only, no inline styles,\n   TypeScript interfaces for props.\n6. You watch every change in VS Code: GREEN lines = added, RED lines = removed.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "impl_w",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
