   "text": "• shadcn wrote --font-sans: var(--font-sans), a variable\n   pointing to ITSELF (broken). The AI noticed and fixed it.\n• shadcn installed an unknown library called \"cn\". The AI\n   checked it was official (from shadcn's GitHub) before\n   trusting it.\n• The AI used \"Write\" (rewrite the whole file) instead of\n   \"Edit\", so you couldn't see the red/green diff. Ask for Edit\n   so you can review each change.",
   "originalText": "• shadcn wrote --font-sans: var(--font-sans), a variable\n   pointing to ITSELF (broken). The AI noticed and fixed it.\n• shadcn installed an unknown library called \"cn\". The AI\n   checked it was official (from shadcn's GitHub) before\n   trusting it.\n• The AI used \"Write\" (rewrite the whole file) instead of\n   \"Edit\", so you couldn't see the red/green diff. Ask for Edit\n   so you can review each change.",
