   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. npm run build: compiles the WHOLE app and checks every TypeScript type. One error =\n   stop.\n2. npm run lint: ESLint looks for bad patterns and unused variables.\n3. npm run dev: starts the app at http://localhost:3000/dashboard.\n4. The AI downloads the page (curl) and checks that words like \"Sidebar\", \"Main\" and\n   \"New Item\" are there.\n5. YOU open the browser and LOOK: colors, spacing, what happens on a small screen. The\n   AI can read HTML, but it can't SEE the design like you do.",
   "originalText": "1. npm run build: compiles the WHOLE app and checks every TypeScript type. One error =\n   stop.\n2. npm run lint: ESLint looks for bad patterns and unused variables.\n3. npm run dev: starts the app at http://localhost:3000/dashboard.\n4. The AI downloads the page (curl) and checks that words like \"Sidebar\", \"Main\" and\n   \"New Item\" are there.\n5. YOU open the browser and LOOK: colors, spacing, what happens on a small screen. The\n   AI can read HTML, but it can't SEE the design like you do.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "test_w",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
