   "text": "🔁 ITERATE  👑🤖: what really happens\nYou tell the AI EXACTLY what's wrong: what you SEE vs what you EXPECTED. The AI changes the code, then we go back to TEST. Rule from ai-interaction.md: if it still fails after 2-3 tries, STOP and explain the\nproblem instead of trying random fixes.\n\n📍 REAL EXAMPLE 1: You said \"you didn't use the same colors of the images, it needs to be exact\".\n→ The AI converted the PNG to a BMP image (easy to read), wrote a small Python script that reads the color of specific pixels, and measured every area: main #0c0d10, sidebar #101117, cards #171920, borders\n   #242830, button #6e64ed, text #edeef5, grey text #858c99.\n→ It put them in globals.css (dark theme) AND added a \"Colors\" table to the phase 1 spec, so the next person (or AI) knows them.\n\n📍 REAL EXAMPLE 2: \"add a couple of examples of data to the dashboard\" → CollectionCard (4 collections, colored by their main type) + ItemCard (3 recent items with type color, preview, tags, star and pin).",
   "originalText": "🔁 ITERATE  👑🤖: what really happens\nYou tell the AI EXACTLY what's wrong: what you SEE vs what you EXPECTED. The AI changes the code, then we go back to TEST. Rule from ai-interaction.md: if it still fails after 2-3 tries, STOP and explain the\nproblem instead of trying random fixes.\n\n📍 REAL EXAMPLE 1: You said \"you didn't use the same colors of the images, it needs to be exact\".\n→ The AI converted the PNG to a BMP image (easy to read), wrote a small Python script that reads the color of specific pixels, and measured every area: main #0c0d10, sidebar #101117, cards #171920, borders\n   #242830, button #6e64ed, text #edeef5, grey text #858c99.\n→ It put them in globals.css (dark theme) AND added a \"Colors\" table to the phase 1 spec, so the next person (or AI) knows them.\n\n📍 REAL EXAMPLE 2: \"add a couple of examples of data to the dashboard\" → CollectionCard (4 collections, colored by their main type) + ItemCard (3 recent items with type color, preview, tags, star and pin).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "it1",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
