   "text": "🔍 5. REVIEW  👑🤖\nIs it GOOD,\nnot just working?",
   "originalText": "🔍 5. REVIEW  👑🤖\nIs it GOOD,\nnot just working?",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
