   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1292824872,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Working ≠ good. You read every changed file in VS Code's Source Control panel\n(Cmd+Shift+G): click a file and you see red/green.\nChecklist from ai-interaction.md:\n• SECURITY: login checks, are inputs validated?\n• PERFORMANCE: useless re-renders, too many database calls?\n• LOGIC: what happens with empty data, weird cases?\n• PATTERNS: does it look like the rest of the project?\nPlus: does it match the spec? No unused imports, no commented-out code, no \"nice to\nhave\" extras nobody asked for.\nYou can also ask the AI for a review (/code-review), but YOU decide.",
   "originalText": "Working ≠ good. You read every changed file in VS Code's Source Control panel\n(Cmd+Shift+G): click a file and you see red/green.\nChecklist from ai-interaction.md:\n• SECURITY: login checks, are inputs validated?\n• PERFORMANCE: useless re-renders, too many database calls?\n• LOGIC: what happens with empty data, weird cases?\n• PATTERNS: does it look like the rest of the project?\nPlus: does it match the spec? No unused imports, no commented-out code, no \"nice to\nhave\" extras nobody asked for.\nYou can also ask the AI for a review (/code-review), but YOU decide.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "review_w",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
