   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Things found while reviewing phase 1:\n• Collection cards use the FIRST type of the collection as their\n   color, not the MOST COMMON type (your original idea). Good\n   enough for now; phase 3 can improve it.\n• The type colors (#3b82f6 blue...) come from project-\n   overview.md and they matched the screenshot.\n• The search box is in the top bar (spec), although the\n   screenshot also has one in the sidebar → the spec wins.",
   "originalText": "Things found while reviewing phase 1:\n• Collection cards use the FIRST type of the collection as their\n   color, not the MOST COMMON type (your original idea). Good\n   enough for now; phase 3 can improve it.\n• The type colors (#3b82f6 blue...) come from project-\n   overview.md and they matched the screenshot.\n• The search box is in the top bar (spec), although the\n   screenshot also has one in the sidebar → the spec wins.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "review_r",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
