   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "It's tempting to skip review because \"the AI wrote it and the\nbuild passed\".\nBut review is where YOU learn how the app works. If you don't\nunderstand a change, ask \"why did you do this?\" before accepting\nit.",
   "originalText": "It's tempting to skip review because \"the AI wrote it and the\nbuild passed\".\nBut review is where YOU learn how the app works. If you don't\nunderstand a change, ask \"why did you do this?\" before accepting\nit.",
