   "text": "🔁 FIX IT  👑🤖: what really happens\nYou list what you don't like, the AI fixes it, and you review again. Small, clear requests work best: one problem per message.\n\n📍 REAL EXAMPLES:\n→ \"I don't like the details you added on current-feature.md\" → the AI made it shorter.\n→ \"you deleted the past info, I need all the information\" → the AI restored Goals and Notes and wrote the finished list inside Status.\n→ \"why are we referencing mock-data.ts?\" → the AI explained it (phases 2 and 3 use it) before changing anything.",
   "originalText": "🔁 FIX IT  👑🤖: what really happens\nYou list what you don't like, the AI fixes it, and you review again. Small, clear requests work best: one problem per message.\n\n📍 REAL EXAMPLES:\n→ \"I don't like the details you added on current-feature.md\" → the AI made it shorter.\n→ \"you deleted the past info, I need all the information\" → the AI restored Goals and Notes and wrote the finished list inside Status.\n→ \"why are we referencing mock-data.ts?\" → the AI explained it (phases 2 and 3 use it) before changing anything.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "it2",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
