   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. git add: choose WHICH files go into the save point (not always all of them!).\n2. git commit -m \"message\": creates the save point = a photo of those files + message +\n   author + a unique ID (hash).\nMessage style (conventional commits): feat: = new feature, fix: = bug fix, docs: =\ndocumentation, chore: = maintenance.\nRules from ai-interaction.md: only after the build passes, only with YOUR permission,\none feature per commit, never \"Generated with Claude\".",
   "originalText": "1. git add: choose WHICH files go into the save point (not always all of them!).\n2. git commit -m \"message\": creates the save point = a photo of those files + message +\n   author + a unique ID (hash).\nMessage style (conventional commits): feat: = new feature, fix: = bug fix, docs: =\ndocumentation, chore: = maintenance.\nRules from ai-interaction.md: only after the build passes, only with YOUR permission,\none feature per commit, never \"Generated with Claude\".",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "commit_w",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
