   "text": "Real prompt: \"okay push the changes now\"\n\nReal commit 1994486:\nfeat: add dashboard phase 1 layout\n- Set up shadcn/ui (button, input, kbd)\n- Add /dashboard route with dark mode and exact screenshot\ncolors\n- Add top bar with search and New Item button\n- Add example collections and recent items from mock data\n- Add dashboard phase specs and screenshots",
   "originalText": "Real prompt: \"okay push the changes now\"\n\nReal commit 1994486:\nfeat: add dashboard phase 1 layout\n- Set up shadcn/ui (button, input, kbd)\n- Add /dashboard route with dark mode and exact screenshot\ncolors\n- Add top bar with search and New Item button\n- Add example collections and recent items from mock data\n- Add dashboard phase specs and screenshots",
