   "text": "On an earlier commit (ea54fc2, the mock data) the AI added \"Co-\nAuthored-By: Claude...\" because a system message told it to.\nYou said: NEVER. The AI saved that in its memory and stopped.\nBetter: write rules like that in CLAUDE.md, so EVERY session and\nevery AI tool sees them.",
   "originalText": "On an earlier commit (ea54fc2, the mock data) the AI added \"Co-\nAuthored-By: Claude...\" because a system message told it to.\nYou said: NEVER. The AI saved that in its memory and stopped.\nBetter: write rules like that in CLAUDE.md, so EVERY session and\nevery AI tool sees them.",
