   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. git push -u origin feature/dashboard-phase-1 → uploads the branch and its commits to\n   GitHub.\n2. Merge: git checkout main → git merge feature/dashboard-phase-1 → git push origin\n   main. Now main has the feature.\n3. Working with a team? Instead of merging directly, open a Pull Request (PR) so someone\n   reviews it first.\n4. Delete the branch (local: git branch -d, remote: git push origin --delete). Your\n   rule: the AI asks before deleting.",
   "originalText": "1. git push -u origin feature/dashboard-phase-1 → uploads the branch and its commits to\n   GitHub.\n2. Merge: git checkout main → git merge feature/dashboard-phase-1 → git push origin\n   main. Now main has the feature.\n3. Working with a team? Instead of merging directly, open a Pull Request (PR) so someone\n   reviews it first.\n4. Delete the branch (local: git branch -d, remote: git push origin --delete). Your\n   rule: the AI asks before deleting.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "merge_w",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
