   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Pushing to main is public and hard to undo.\n\"Force push\" (rewriting history that's already on GitHub) can\ndelete other people's work, so only do it with an explicit OK.\nWhen the AI offered to remove Co-Authored-By from ea54fc2, it\nASKED first, because that needed a force push on main.",
   "originalText": "Pushing to main is public and hard to undo.\n\"Force push\" (rewriting history that's already on GitHub) can\ndelete other people's work, so only do it with an explicit OK.\nWhen the AI offered to remove Co-Authored-By from ea54fc2, it\nASKED first, because that needed a force push on main.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
