   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The AI updates current-feature.md:\n• Status → Completed + a list of what was done\n• Goals and Notes stay, so you remember what was planned\n• One summary line is added to History\nHistory is the project's diary: months later you (or the AI) can read what was built and\nin what order.",
   "originalText": "The AI updates current-feature.md:\n• Status → Completed + a list of what was done\n• Goals and Notes stay, so you remember what was planned\n• One summary line is added to History\nHistory is the project's diary: months later you (or the AI) can read what was built and\nin what order.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "done_w",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
