   "locked": false,
   "text": "The first time, the AI EMPTIED the sections (that's what your\nsaved prompt said: \"remove the info and add it to the history\").\nYou wanted to keep everything.\nLesson: decide the format ONCE and write it in ai-\ninteraction.md, so the AI doesn't have to guess.",
   "originalText": "The first time, the AI EMPTIED the sections (that's what your\nsaved prompt said: \"remove the info and add it to the history\").\nYou wanted to keep everything.\nLesson: decide the format ONCE and write it in ai-\ninteraction.md, so the AI doesn't have to guess.",
