   "text": "• Phase 2: collapsible sidebar, links per type (/items/snippets), favorite and recent\n   collections, user area at the bottom, mobile drawer.\n• Phase 3: main area with 4 stats cards, recent collections, pinned items, 10 recent\n   items.\n• Then: database (Prisma + Neon), login (NextAuth), real CRUD, file uploads, payments,\n   AI features.\nSame loop for every one of them: PLAN → DOCUMENT → BRANCH → IMPLEMENT → TEST → REVIEW →\nCOMMIT → MERGE → DONE.",
   "originalText": "• Phase 2: collapsible sidebar, links per type (/items/snippets), favorite and recent\n   collections, user area at the bottom, mobile drawer.\n• Phase 3: main area with 4 stats cards, recent collections, pinned items, 10 recent\n   items.\n• Then: database (Prisma + Neon), login (NextAuth), real CRUD, file uploads, payments,\n   AI features.\nSame loop for every one of them: PLAN → DOCUMENT → BRANCH → IMPLEMENT → TEST → REVIEW →\nCOMMIT → MERGE → DONE.",
   "fontSize": 16,
